        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎Pituitary tumor compressing optic chiasm"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎types: microadenoma <1 cm, macroadenoma >1 cm, prolactinoma, GH-secreting, nonfunctioning, ACTH-secreting, TSH-secreting, carcinoma"
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "table_cell",
        "attrs": {
         "colspan": 1,
         "rowspan": 1,
         "colwidth": null,
         "fill": "F8F9DF",
         "vAlign": "top",
         "borders": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎can cause unilateral HA but more often impaired vision, nonspecific HA, hormone deficiencies; not sudden like cluster; worsens as tumor grows"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎prolactinoma → ⇡prolactin (hyperprolactinemia): galactorrhea, amenorrhea/menstrual chgs, ⇣libido, vaginal dryness, dyspareunia, osteoporosis; consider in ddx of irreg menses, esp in women younger than avg perimenopausal age"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎visual pathway lesions: L optic nerve compression → unilateral field loss; chiasmal compression from pituitary tumor → bitemporal hemianopsia; L cerebrovascular event → homonymous hemianopsia"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎ACTH-secreting → Cushing dz (excess cortisol)"
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "table_cell",
        "attrs": {
         "colspan": 1,
         "rowspan": 1,
         "colwidth": null,
         "fill": "F8F9DF",
         "vAlign": "top",
         "borders": null
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎MRI w/ + w/o contrast to exclude brain or pituitary abnormalities"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎serum prolactin: helpful in amenorrhea workup (⇡prolactin → absent or scant menses)"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎TSH-secreting: ⇡TSH, ⇡T4, ⇡T3"
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "type": "table_cell",
